  "question": {
    "text": "A battery is charged at a potential of 15 V in 8 h when the current flowing is 10A. The battery on discharge supplies a current of 5A for 15 h. The mean terminal voltage during discharge is 14V. What is the watt-hour efficiency of the battery?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "87.5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "The power of the battery, when charged is given by<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><br />The electrical energy dissipated is given by<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>1200</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>W</mi><mi>h</mi></math><br /><br />Similarly, the electrical energy dissipated during the discharge of battery is given by<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>15</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>1050</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>W</mi><mi>h</mi></math><br /><br />Hence, watt-hour efficiency of the battery is given by<br /><br /><math><mi>η</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>0.875</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>87.5</mn><mi>%</mi></math>",
    "image": null
  },
